# Agent coordination

- Read root `AGENTS.md`, `docs/AGENT_ROLES.md`, and `docs/AGENT_TASKS.md`
  before starting a task or editing files. They are the shared source of truth.
- Read `docs/agents/SKILL.md`; search for relevant handoffs, write only your
  own log, and coordinate improvements to the common skill.
- Work only in the assigned role, task, and files; skills do not expand scope.
- Ask the Lead to resolve overlapping ownership or necessary scope changes.
- Example: a reviewer finding a route bug reports it to Backend through the
  Lead; the reviewer does not silently patch the route.
- Hand off results when finished; do not independently start more work.
